The first one are the predicted and updated estimation.

33
00:03:52,206 --> 00:04:02,144
与之相关的是一个误差协方差矩阵，由于我们不知
道系统的真实状态，所以无法预先知道这个矩阵。
And associated with it, we have a matrix, an error covariance matrix, which is not
possible to know in advance because we don't know the real state of the system.

34
00:04:02,224 --> 00:04:06,628
因此，我们拥有该矩阵对应的预测版本和更新版本。
So we have their corresponding predicted and updated version of that matrix.

